OL,3,AManga-inspired theme park to be built
OL,4,Anear Paris
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree theme parks will be built near
OL,7,FParis as part of a bB,6bn (#5.13bn)
OL,8,Fdeal agreed between France and Saudi
OL,9,FArabia.
OL,11,FThe new development is expected to
OL,12,Finclude a manga-themed park, inspired
OL,13,Fby the popular Japanese franchise
OL,14,FDragon Ball Z.
OL,16,FFrench President Emmanuel Macron hailed
OL,17,Fthe move as on a scale not seen "since
OL,18,FDisneyland Paris", and added "you know
OL,19,Fmy interest for manga".
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
