OL,3,AManga-inspired theme park to be built
OL,4,Anear Paris
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn opening date for the parks - which
OL,7,Fwill be built near Cergy-Pontoise - has
OL,8,Fnot been set by the Elysee Palace, but
OL,9,Fthey will open in stages and
OL,10,Fconstruction is expected to take years.
